  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3086 squash-merged to master (62fdf29811, Closes #3062) after a main-session review. ILookupItem gains an optional secondaryText that LookupField renders under the name only when set (Fluent tokens), so every other consumer renders as before (DOM test). Person candidates in the Decision wizard carry the email as that line (unless the name already contains it); the picked person and the Confirm summary read "Name (email)", display only, the commit sends ids. The Console's Lookup Records pane is the platform pane: whether its contact view lists Email is a dev check for the main session. Console auto-deploys from master.</completion>
